# The host punches a crate open; a guest breaks glass with a thrown rock (an impact claim).
scenario breakables_break
scene breakables
seed 17
guests 1
settle 10s

net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 20ms loss 2%

p0 punch crate as crate
p1 grab rock as rock
p1 wait 400ms
p1 throw glass speed 7 as throw

expect result crate hit
expect result rock granted
expect result throw done
expect effects_once
expect agree_at_rest 5cm
expect no_stuck
